# C081 — RECURSIVE route composition: seq/all/branch fold a PLAN TREE into ONE route, and the whole contract (request /
# response / errors / COST / rate-limit) MERGES up the tree — the effect.ts-style bubbling for the Suluk v4 Request model.
# @suluk/effect 0.6.0 + @suluk/cost combine.ts. Additive over C080 (effectRoute untouched; the 5 linear todo routes byte-identical).

# The linear `actions[]` AST (C080) is generalized to a `PlanNode` TREE (leaf | seq | all | branch) — a discriminated union on
# `kind`, so every walk (foldPlan/leavesOf/terminalWrapOf) is exhaustive and a 5th kind is a COMPILE error. `pipeline`/`chain`
# build seq roots (byte-compat); `seq` is the nestable variadic; `all` FANS OUT (branches on the same input, tupled outputs,
# their envelopes ZIPPED into one merged wire body `{ todo } ⊕ { count } = { todo, count }`); `branch` picks an arm on the input.
# A step may be an action OR a pipeline, so composition is RECURSIVE to any depth. Err/R UNION at every node/depth (no cliff —
# strictly better than the linear variadic's any-collapse); `all`'s Out is a position-preserving mapped tuple. @>=0.85
claim c081_plan_tree_recursive_combinators: Bool @>=0.85 = True
falsified_when c081_plan_tree_recursive_combinators == False

# COST BUBBLES UP via a CostModel MONOID (@suluk/cost combine.ts — the piece that did NOT exist before): combineCost/sumCost
# with identity emptyCost — infra ADDS key-wise, components CONCAT, estimate ADDS, settlement takes the STRONGEST recovery
# method (credit ≻ subscription ≻ trust ≻ rate-limited ≻ lead ≻ free) with credits summed, and background-cost facets
# (trigger/attribution/reconciliation/amount*) AGREE-or-throw (fail loud — no additive join). Associative + commutative, so a
# tree's cost is order-independent. effectPipeRoute SUMS every leaf's declared `cost` (+ one worker.request the single HTTP call
# incurs) into the route cost; if no leaf declares one it stays undefined → effectRoute's roles-default (byte-identical). @>=0.85
claim c081_cost_model_monoid_bubbles: Bool @>=0.85 = True
falsified_when c081_cost_model_monoid_bubbles == False

# RATE-LIMIT bubbles as TIGHTEST-wins (sound: calling the route once calls each leaf once, so a leaf's cap BOUNDS the route —
# tightening, never loosening): effectPipeRoute takes the smallest normalized rate (maxRequests/windowMs) across the leaves'
# declared budgets; the `key` stays ROUTE-owned (roles: authed→principal, public→ip), never merged from a leaf. Request body =
# the ENTRY leaf's `input` (single-owner election over the tree); response = the terminal wrap; errors = the union over ALL
# leaves (both arms of a branch). D1-safe (a plan tree adds NO matcher-read facet — it changes only how run composes + how the
# contract is derived); document-is-a-projection + declared-not-enforced held. Proven: 57 @suluk/effect tests (15 new: all/
# branch/cost-sum/tightest-rate-limit/key-collision-throws/recursion) + 67 @suluk/cost tests (9 new monoid + laws); tsc clean.
# todo module SHOWCASE: getTodoDetail GET /api/todos/:id/detail = all(getTodo, countTodos) → { todo, count }, cost d1.read×2. @>=0.85
claim c081_ratelimit_tightest_and_walk_invariants: Bool @>=0.85 = True
falsified_when c081_ratelimit_tightest_and_walk_invariants == False
